  "description": "1 Bedroom apartment to rent in Alexander House, Tallaght Cross East.\n\n*** please refer to video in media section of this ad.\n\nComer Group Ireland is delighted to bring to the rental market this beautiful 1 bedroom apartment at Tallaght Cross East. Property consists of a double bedroom, bathroom, storage room, living room, kitchen and balcony. Apartment comes fully furnished - double bed, mattress and two bedside lockers in the bedrooms, as well as sofa, coffee table, TV stand and kitchen table and chairs in the living area. All integrated appliances (washer/dryer, dishwasher, fridge, freezer, etc) are supplied in the kitchen.\n\nVideo of apartment in media section of this ad.\n\nLocated at the epicentre of a transpirational hub, Tallaght Cross East boasts a whole host of amenities right on your door step. With the Red Line Luas at the foot of the development, the M50 being just minutes away, and the N81 running adjacent to the complex, not to mention all major bus routes converging across the road, getting to and from here is hassle free. Within the development itself is ample secure parking (there is an additional monthly charge of €50 to avail of a car space), around the clock security and a management team which is on call 24-7, you can rest assured that this modern complex has all bases covered. Tallaght Cross East is substantially well serviced, with all amenities right on you door step, from the Glashaus Hotel and Ostan Bar (on site), Aldi, Tallaght Hospital, Tallaght IT and The Civic Library to name but a few. Refuse included, Sky and UPC available to all apartments (not included in rental price). Apartment in pristine condition for letting.\n\n*Apartment available for immediate letting only*\n\n\n**Electric / Storage Heating**\n\n***Secure underground car park available - there is an additional monthly charge of €50 to avail of a car space ***\n\nEnquiries via daft.ie only. Interested parties need to click on the ad for the relevant property within this development page to be able to send an email query.\n\nNO PHONE CALLS PLEASE. Please do not contact either the Comer Group Ireland or Comer Group UK head office regarding lettings, as these are handled via the lettings department directly. Any queries through the main office will be disregarded.",
